sequenceDiagram
    title Create Plan — cnext-hrms (fortest) against the HRCenter-DEV replica
    actor HR as HR Admin
    participant UI as Web App (localhost:3200)
    participant API as Next route /api/benefit-plans
    participant DB as PostgreSQL HRCenter-DEV
    HR->>UI: open Benefits › Plans and click Create Plan
    HR->>UI: fill the plan form and save
    UI->>API: POST /api/benefit-plans
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO benefit_management.benefit_plan
    DB-->>API: id
    alt valid plan
        API-->>UI: 200 { ok: true, dbId }
        UI->>API: GET /api/benefit-plans
    else missing id or name
        API-->>UI: 400 { ok: false }
    end
